[TITLE]
IO-58: storage unit SU1 (1000 ft2, constant area) starts 5 ft deep, i.e. with
5000 ft3 stored, and receives a lateral inflow of 1 cfs for the whole 2-hour
run (7200 ft3). It has no inflowing links and drains through orifice OR1.

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CFS
INFILTRATION         HORTON
FLOW_ROUTING         DYNWAVE
START_DATE           01/01/2020
START_TIME           00:00:00
REPORT_START_DATE    01/01/2020
REPORT_START_TIME    00:00:00
END_DATE             01/01/2020
END_TIME             02:00:00
REPORT_STEP          00:05:00
WET_STEP             00:05:00
DRY_STEP             00:05:00
ROUTING_STEP         0:00:10

[OUTFALLS]
;;Name  Elev  Type
O1      0     FREE

[STORAGE]
;;Name  Elev  MaxDepth  InitDepth  Shape       Coeff  Exp  Const  SurDepth  Fevap
SU1     0     10        5          FUNCTIONAL  0      0    1000   0         0

[ORIFICES]
;;Name  From  To  Type    Offset  Qcoeff  Gated  CloseTime
OR1     SU1   O1  BOTTOM  0       0.65    NO     0

[XSECTIONS]
;;Link  Shape        Geom1  Geom2  Geom3  Geom4
OR1     CIRCULAR     0.25   0      0      0

[INFLOWS]
;;Node  Constituent  TimeSeries  Type  Mfactor  Sfactor  Baseline
SU1     FLOW         ""          FLOW  1.0      1.0      1.0

[REPORT]
INPUT NO
